<title>LATVIA: Latvian Nov unemployment unchanged at 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Latvian Nov unemployment unchanged at 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in the Baltic state of Latvia was unchanged at 7.1 percent in November, the statistics committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYEMENT     Nov '96     Oct '96     Nov '95</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     7.1	   7.1	  6.3</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 90,100	89,000     79,900</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
